## Commands Quick Reference

Bun is the runtime (`>=1.3.14`); pnpm is the dependency manager (`pnpm@11`). The app
uses `bun:sqlite` and will not run on Node.js.

- Install deps: `pnpm install` (run `corepack enable` first) — never `bun install` or `npm install`
- Dev servers: `bun run dev` → Next.js on `http://localhost:3000` + Bun API on `:3201`
- Build: `bun run build` (Next build + `assert-standalone-clean` gate)
- Lint: `bun run lint` (`--max-warnings=0`). Autofix: `bun run lint:fix`
- Types: `bun run typecheck`
- Format: `bun run format`
- Tests: `bun run test -- --run` (Vitest once). Single file:
  `bun x vitest tests/lib/bet-generator.test.ts --run`
- E2E: `bun run test:e2e` (Playwright)
- DB: `bun run db:migrate`, then `bun run db:pull` to ingest draws from the CAIXA API

Security & config:

- Copy `.env.example` to `.env.local`. `IP_HASH_SECRET` (≥32 chars) is required in
  production — the server exits without it.
- Secret scans: `bun run security:secrets`, `bun run security:secrets:history`.
- There is no Supabase here; the database is a local SQLite file under `db/`.

Full contract: `AGENTS.md` at the repo root.
